WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.868 --> 00:00:01.901
-Our first guest tonight

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.901
is a congressman
from Queens, New York,

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:06.067
who's involved in a lot of
controversy right now.

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:07.567
Here to set the record straight,

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:10.100
please welcome
Congressman George Santos.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:17.767
♪♪

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:23.434
♪♪

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:26.100
-Mr. Santos,
welcome to the show.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.100
-Oh, hi, James.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.767
Thanks for fitting me in.

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:32.434
Mmm.

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:35.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:38.534
I'm just in town to pick up
my Nobel Peace Prize.

00:00:38.534 --> 00:00:40.000
-Oh. Congratulations.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.501
-Yeah, perform a couple nights
at Madison Square Garden, mm.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:44.400
-I didn't know
you were playing MSG.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.467
-Yes, yes.

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:46.934
I'll be singing
all my hit songs --

00:00:46.934 --> 00:00:48.601
"Piano Man,"

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:49.868
"Hey Jude,"

00:00:49.868 --> 00:00:51.200
"Happy Birthday."

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.701 --> 00:00:53.868
-Well, I'm glad you're here,
Congressman,

00:00:53.868 --> 00:00:55.200
because I have some questions.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.734
A lot of people
have called you out

00:00:56.734 --> 00:00:59.234
for lying about details
in your life.

00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:01.968
What do you have to say to that?
-Well, you know,

00:01:01.968 --> 00:01:04.467
I don't consider
the things I've said to be lies.

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:06.968
They're what my
great-grandfather,

00:01:06.968 --> 00:01:08.968
Winston Churchill...

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:12.467
He would call them
embellishments.

00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:13.968
Embellishments, you know.

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:15.133
I embellish.

00:01:15.133 --> 00:01:17.467
And on my hot dog, I put relish.
Mmm.

00:01:17.467 --> 00:01:18.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.467 --> 00:01:21.968
I relish the embellish, Jimmy.

00:01:21.968 --> 00:01:22.968
-Now, you --

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:24.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:27.300
You said on your résumé that
you worked for Goldman Sachs,

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:28.834
and that is just not true.

00:01:28.834 --> 00:01:30.167
-No, alright.

00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:31.167
Fine, alright.

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:32.801
That, no -- That is...

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:36.234
The truth is I did not work
for Goldman Sachs.

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:37.634
-Hm.

00:01:37.634 --> 00:01:39.300
-I AM Goldman Sachs.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.634
Yes, I founded the company
many years ago.

00:01:43.634 --> 00:01:46.100
But I changed my name
to George Santos

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:49.434
because who wants
the last name Sachs?

00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:51.434
It stinks!

00:01:51.434 --> 00:01:53.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.934 --> 00:01:55.934
-What about your education?

00:01:55.934 --> 00:01:56.934
What about your education?

00:01:56.934 --> 00:01:58.267
Where did you actually go
to school?

00:01:58.267 --> 00:01:59.701
-Well, I'll be honest with you,
Jimmy.

00:01:59.701 --> 00:02:03.601
I went to high school
in Euphoria, you see.

00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:05.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:09.267
But they kicked me out after
I broke up with Sydney Sweeney.

00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:10.767
-You also lied
about being Jewish.

00:02:10.767 --> 00:02:13.100
-No, no, no, no, no.
I never said I was Jewish.

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.267
I said I was Jew-ish.

00:02:15.267 --> 00:02:16.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.601 --> 00:02:17.601
Yes.

00:02:17.601 --> 00:02:19.601
No, I did.
It's what I said.

00:02:19.601 --> 00:02:22.000
No, the truth is,
I'm a part-time Jew.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.834 --> 00:02:25.300
I am. Yes.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.968
In my spare time, I'm
the prime minister of Israel.

00:02:27.968 --> 00:02:29.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.801 --> 00:02:31.300
But I'm not only Jew-ish --

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:35.467
I'm Ir-ish, I'm Scott-ish,

00:02:35.467 --> 00:02:37.634
and I'm half-fish.

00:02:37.634 --> 00:02:39.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.634
Delish!

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:44.801
-Now, you...

00:02:44.801 --> 00:02:46.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:51.267
You got some big
responsibilities now, okay?

00:02:51.267 --> 00:02:52.934
You've been added
to the House Committee

00:02:52.934 --> 00:02:55.100
on Science, Space,
and Technology.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.934
-Mm-hmm.
-Do you know much about that?

00:02:56.934 --> 00:02:58.934
-Yes, yes, I've always been
involved in science.

00:02:58.934 --> 00:03:00.434
You know, not to brag,

00:03:00.434 --> 00:03:03.100
but it was my idea to have
gravity, you know?

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:06.968
No, listen, before I showed up,
if you dropped something,

00:03:06.968 --> 00:03:09.133
it would just float up
into the air.

00:03:09.133 --> 00:03:10.634
Watch this.

00:03:13.801 --> 00:03:15.300
You're welcome!

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:16.467
-Alright, well...

00:03:16.467 --> 00:03:19.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:19.634 --> 00:03:21.300
Thank you.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.167
You're also being investigated
by the House Ethics Committee.

00:03:24.167 --> 00:03:25.501
Are you worried?

00:03:25.501 --> 00:03:27.467
-Well, why would I be?
I have nothing to hide.

00:03:27.467 --> 00:03:29.467
My name is George Santos.
-Mm-hmm.

00:03:29.467 --> 00:03:31.634
-I'm seven feet tall.

00:03:31.634 --> 00:03:33.634
I invented baseball.

00:03:33.634 --> 00:03:35.868
And "The Avengers" is based
on my friend group.

00:03:35.868 --> 00:03:37.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.033 --> 00:03:38.534
-Before you go, Congressman,

00:03:38.534 --> 00:03:40.200
there are millions of people
watching right now --

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.667
is there anything you want
to say to them?

00:03:42.667 --> 00:03:44.834
-Yes, there is.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:48.167 --> 00:03:56.634
♪♪

00:03:56.634 --> 00:04:01.200
♪ Regrets, I have none ♪

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.868
-Did you say you have none?

00:04:02.868 --> 00:04:04.868
-♪ I have a son ♪

00:04:04.868 --> 00:04:08.534
♪ He's Harry Styles ♪

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:11.200
♪ Got first place ♪

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:14.200
♪ New York marathon ♪

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:19.200
♪ I even ran three extra miles ♪

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:23.534
♪ I've won every Super Bowl ♪

00:04:23.534 --> 00:04:26.701
♪ Don't believe me? ♪

00:04:26.701 --> 00:04:29.534
♪ Check my résumé ♪

00:04:29.534 --> 00:04:34.868
♪ It's called the Holy Bible ♪

00:04:34.868 --> 00:04:40.367
♪ I did it my way ♪

00:04:40.367 --> 00:04:43.033
[ Cheers and applause ]
-George Santos, everybody!

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:45.534
-It's true, I tell you.
It's true!

00:04:45.534 --> 00:04:48.534
All the lies. It's true!
-No, no, George --

00:04:48.534 --> 00:04:50.033
-I'm Jimmy Fallon!
-No, you're not!

00:04:50.033 --> 00:04:51.067
-This is my show!

00:04:51.067 --> 00:04:52.234
-No, it's not your show.

00:04:52.234 --> 00:04:53.734
George!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:53.734 --> 00:04:55.901
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

00:04:55.901 --> 00:04:57.133
Get him out of here.

